Project Development Phase
During the development phase, the planned design was converted into a working application.
The frontend was developed using HTML and CSS. It provides forms for entering the user's name, user ID, age, weight, fitness goal, fitness level, workout intensity and available time.
The backend was developed using FastAPI in Python.
The Gemini service was implemented to perform three major tasks.
First, Gemini generates the user's 7-day workout plan.
Second, Gemini generates general nutrition, hydration and recovery tips.
Third, Gemini updates the existing workout plan according to the user's feedback.
The database was developed using SQLite and SQLAlchemy. User details and fitness plans are stored in the database.
The application also includes an admin view for viewing users and managing stored information.
